	(text "02 - Power Rails and Switching\nVSYS fans out by name to two rows. The slide switch pulls GATE low to\nenable Q2 and Q3 together and carries only microamps.\nRow 1: TPS63020 buck-boost makes the 3V3 for BOTH boards (~1.3 A) from\n3.0-4.2 V; row 2: VMOT for the motors and the Vision board's servos." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b1a00003-0000-4000-8000-000000000116"))
